  <hr style="width: 50%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
  <p>Andrews University educates its students for generous service to the church and society in keeping a faithful witness to Christ and to the worldwide mission of the Seventh-day Adventist church.</p>
  <p>Accordingly, students are challenged:</p>
